        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "To a solution of methyl salicylate (0.65 mL, 5.0 mmol) in THF (15 mL) in a 150 mL Schlenk flask was added ZnEt2 (2.0 mmol, 2 mL) dropwise under nitrogen. The mixture was stirred at room temperature for 3 h. LuCl3 (0.3870 g, 1.38 mmol) and methanol (25 mL) were then added, and the mixture was stirred for an additional 72 h. The solution was left undisturbed to crystallize for 3 weeks. Colorless crystals of 6 were collected by filtration, washed with hexane (3 × 10 mL), and dried under vacuum.",
